<article class="work">
	<p>Mobino is a mobile digital payment service launched by web pioneer Jean-François Groff. </p>
	<p>My contribution touched every aspect of the service: prototyping and redesigning the mobile apps, defining the marketing message, and producing communication materials, the website, and the visual identity.</p>
  <div class="image-bloc">
